	"Name": "Yoba Coins",
	"Author": "aedenthorn",
	"Description": "This mod contains a set of four coins added to the game using Dynamic Game Assets. \n<br />\n<br />It also contains an information pack for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9843/]Coin Collector[/url] that lets the coins be found by that mod's metal detector.\n<br />\n<br />The coins are:\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Copper Yoba coin, worth 100 gold\n<br />[*]Silver Yoba coin, worth 1,000 gold\n<br />[*]Gold Yoba coin, worth 10,000 gold\n<br />[*]Iridium Yoba coin, worth 100,000 gold\n<br />[/list]\n<br />To install, place both the [DGA] and the [CC] folders in the game's Mods folder.\n<br />\n<br />A list of all my mods for Stardew Valley is available at [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/articles/895]https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/articles/895[/url].",
